if {TEST_DOOR} == false:
	bailey: TEST_DOOR IS FALSE
	bailey: WHILE FALSE, OPEN/CLOSE BEHAVIOR OF DOOR IS DISABLED
	bailey: DO YOU WANT TO SET TEST_DOOR TO TRUE?
	- YES
		set {TEST_DOOR} = true
		set {Gamedata..TEST_DOOR} = true
		bailey: [b]TEST_DOOR[/b] IS NOW TRUE. DIALOGUE DISABLED AND OPEN/CLOSE BEHAVIOR ENABLED
		[end_timeline]
	- NO
		bailey: [b]TEST_DOOR[/b] REMAINS FALSE
		[end_timeline]
else:
	set {Gamedata.TEST_DOOR} = true
	[signal arg="test_door_react"]
	[end_timeline]